prompt_template:
Create a finished {ASPECT_RATIO} editorial art poster, use case stylized-concept. Visual system: {STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
NEW SUBJECT: {SUBJECT}
DESIGN INTENTION: {DESIGN_DIRECTION}
For 9:16 use: {PORTRAIT_LAYOUT}
For 16:9 use: {LANDSCAPE_LAYOUT}
Choose only the layout matching the requested ratio. Exact large title: "{MAIN_TEXT}". Exact small caption: "{SECONDARY_TEXT}". Design oversized sharp-cut italic serif white display lettering, with a filled title behind selected subject regions and a delicate outline echo over the foreground; ensure a complete readable title. Add one small black engineering sketch based on this subject and sparse fine rules. Flat vermilion background, cool grayscale subject, deep charcoal shadows and chalk white highlights. Medium: painterly graphic concept illustration under hard raking light. Texture: fine restrained print grain across red ground; visible medium-scale dry angular brush and scratch strokes on subject material with selective soft painted transitions. Deliberate type edges; no heavy grunge. Source-specific content to exclude: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}. No logos, watermark, signature, QR code, extra large text, glossy CGI, neon, photographic scenery or crowded interface. Output one finished poster, no mockup or contact sheet.
